                                "sense_id": "2d4f6ccd-26ea-3b53-952c-5210fcf624c5",
                                "text": "It is in the region of the Island that most of the battles take place between organized labour and the apostles of free labour. Let there be any industrial trouble of any kind, and down upon the district swoop dozens of fussy futilitarians, to argue, exhort, bully, and agitate generally."
